Z||000000||annieL||08-13-2001||02:09 PM||||I was watching the TV with the kiddies this morning and I gotta tell ya Spongebob Squarepants is the funniest cartoon i've ever seen! I wanted to give you a few examples:<P>1) Spongebob and his sidekick Patrick (a very stupid Starfish)have a friend named Sandy (she's a squirrel) when she went into hibernation and got real fat they wanted to see what you do when you hibernate. Well she got real mad at them both and picked them up by the back of their necks (I didn't know starfish or sponges had necks)and Spongebob covered his goodies!!!<BR>2) Spongebob got a cold but it was called "The Suds" and his cure was to get washed.<BR>3) The town they live in is called "Bikini Bottom".<P>There are a ton of funny things to list but I want to see if you have any favorites now or when you were a kid and if you still watch them. Hey Cartoon Networks plays everything.<P>Also high on my list is:<BR>Scooby Doo and Johny Bravo<P>I cannot believe I am 28 and asking about cartoons........ <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
